```

If the capability assessment has maturity_blocks, the elicited scores for those dimensions are not credible. They contribute 0 to the fixed-weight lisp_eval score while the blocks remain explicit in the assessment; this is a maturity penalty, not a measured capability score. A verdict with fewer than 4 credible dimensions is weaker.
{% endif %}

