{{ simon_inquiry | tojson }}

In Business Franchise, use only source-supported niche leadership and its customer-value mechanism. Address concentration, saturation and exceptions when they change durability. Unknown leadership stays unknown; a missing Simon characteristic is not a quality-gate failure. Do not translate this inquiry into the fixed GORILLA score or a hidden-champion certificate.
